I would like to be able to tell any digital assistant enabled device in my home to &quot;play latest episode of Dirk Gently&#x27;s Holistic Detective Agency on the living room TV&quot; and have it work. I feel like that&#x27;s a very simple, minimal viable product, sort of request.
Siri responds with &quot;Hmm, I&#x27;m not finding anything for that.&quot;<p>I&#x27;d also like to be able to ask &quot;How many steps have I taken today?&quot;
Siri responds with &quot;I can&#x27;t answer that on your iPhone but you can find it in the Health app: Open the Health app&quot;<p>This may feel like a big ask considering the majority of the basics aren&#x27;t covered on the platform I&#x27;m using, but compound questions would be wonderful – &quot;show me the thirty largest US cities&quot; &quot;remove any that do not have a moderate climate&quot; &quot;which one has the lowest cost of living?&quot;<p>If platforms already provide these services and I&#x27;m simply using the wrong one – oops.
